{
  "id": "guilloche",
  "label": "Guilloche Engraving",
  "engine": "three",
  "kind": "picture",
  "mood": "banknote and certificate engraving — hundreds of even hairlines in one or two inks braided into rope-like ribbons, interlaced rosette rings round a medallion and lattice borders, over a pale wave underprint on rag paper, with the copy in a blank cartouche. Precise, trustworthy, quietly luxurious. Good for finance and business events, awards and ceremonies, anniversaries, premium launches, heritage and culture, invitations.",
